Package: dfeols
Type: Package
Title: R Client for 'dfeols' Interactive Sessions
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Ted", "Matherly", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "jemather@gmail.com")
Description: Attaches to a running 'dfeols' session (a manager that has absorbed a set of
    fixed effects once on a large dataset) and fits models against it, speaking the session's
    request files, so no network path to the compute node is needed. Each model comes back as
    an 'estrec' record, which 'estrec' gives tidy() and glance() methods for, so
    'modelsummary' and other table packages take it as they take a fitted model.
License: GPL (>= 3)
URL: https://github.com/jemather/dfeols
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports: jsonlite, estrec, stats, utils
Suggests: modelsummary
Remotes: estrec/estrec/r
Encoding: UTF-8
